; range/sort/filter/some/every
0 5 range length print
0 5 range 3 get print
list 3 append 1 append 2 append sort 0 get print
0 10 range 'even filter length print
0 10 range 'big any print
0 10 range 'big all print
; orelse
0 42 orelse print
7 42 orelse print
; group/agg/unique/flat/chunk
0 10 range 'pmod group_by g!
g@ 0 get length print
g@ 'gsum aggregate a!
a@ 1 get print
list 1 append 2 append 2 append 3 append 1 append unique length print
list list 1 append 2 append append list 3 append append 4 append flatten length print
0 7 range 3 chunk length print
0 7 range 3 chunk 2 get length print
ret
; --- quotation bodies ---
even: 2 rem 0 eq ret
big: 5 gt ret
pmod: 3 rem ret
gsum: lst! lst@ length n! n@ int array a! n@ 'cp for a@ sum ret
cp: k! lst@ k@ get v! a@ k@ v@ set ret
